WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.625 --> 00:00:03.586
[upbeat music]

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.048
(Ife)
<i>It's been almost a year</i>

00:00:07.048 --> 00:00:08.174
<i>since I've seen
my classmates.</i>

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:08.925
<i>It's been so long.</i>

00:00:09.008 --> 00:00:10.593 align:end position:100% line:76%
Everyone's gathered
again together

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:12.721 align:end position:100% line:76%
it's a great reunion,
yeah it's fantastic!

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:18.435 size:84% position:42% line:78%
It feels like we never left

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:20.019 align:start position:0% line:76%
and at the same time it feels
like it's been a lifetime

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:21.271 align:start position:0% line:78%
since we've been here.

00:00:21.271 --> 00:00:24.232 align:start size:3% position:97% line:7%
♪

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:34.492
(Won)
<i>It feels a little surreal
to be back</i>

00:00:34.492 --> 00:00:36.619 align:end position:100% line:76%
I'm actually coming
from internationally

00:00:36.619 --> 00:00:38.955 align:end position:100% line:76%
so to come all the way back
here and to have

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:40.999 align:end position:100% line:76%
wonderful people put
together this weekend for us

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:42.500 align:start size:53% position:47% line:78%
has been awesome.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.379
[bagpipes playing]

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:49.340
[drumming]

00:00:55.013 --> 00:00:59.434
[cheers and applause]

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:05.440
[band playing]

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.948 align:start size:25% position:75%
Hi!

00:01:15.533 --> 00:01:18.495
Welcome back to Yale!

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:20.705
[applause]

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:25.376
[cheers and applause]

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:27.754
(President Salovey)
<i>More than for having</i>

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:32.008 line:68%
your college years coincide with
a pandemic at its worst,

00:01:32.008 --> 00:01:37.555 line:68%
you will be remembered for
representing Yale at its best.

00:01:37.555 --> 00:01:40.517
<i>Today we salute your sacrifice,</i>

00:01:40.517 --> 00:01:43.061
<i>sacrifice that has solidified</i>

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:46.940
your rightful place
in history.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:49.484
<i>By the authority vested in me
it was my honor to</i>

00:01:49.484 --> 00:01:53.488
<i>confer upon you the degree
as designated by the Dean</i>

00:01:53.488 --> 00:01:57.367
<i>and admit you to all its rights
and responsibilities.</i>

00:01:57.367 --> 00:02:00.328
[cheers and applause]

